This distribution contains the Python binding and the TapirusDB database engine.

The existing Python package metadata declares the binding under MIT. The
embedded TapirusDB engine is subject to the repository's Business Source
License 1.1 parameters, reproduced in CORE_LICENSE. The combined wheel is
therefore described as MIT AND BUSL-1.1. The binding's MIT declaration does not
relicense the embedded engine. The engine's existing use grant and change
date remain as recorded in CORE_LICENSE.
